Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:05.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,HerWay. Not the fastest way home — the safest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:10.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nine in ten women say street harassment shapes how they walk home —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:16.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,and most route planners only optimize for speed. HerWay optimizes for something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:22.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is HerWay. Pick two points and it scores every walking option —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:28.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,lighting, foot traffic, open businesses, community reports — then recommends the safest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:34.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Each candidate route gets a transparent score, so the trade-off between the fastest street
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:38.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the safest one is a choice the user actually sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:43.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,Slide the clock. A plaza that's fine at noon can be a risk at two a. m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:48.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,the same streets re-score live because safety isn't static.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:51.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Under the hood it's four signals —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:56.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,lighting, foot traffic, open-late storefronts, and incident reports —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:02.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,weighted by time of day. Every score explains itself. No black box.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:08.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Anyone can flag a dark stretch. Every report instantly re-scores the streets around it —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.98,0:01:11.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,the map learns from the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:14.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,Safe Walk follows the trip —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.23,0:01:21.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,live ETA, quiet check-ins, and a warning the moment you step into a dark stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:28.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,One long press: guardians get your live position, the nearest safe havens, and your street
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:30.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,address — ready to read out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:39.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,And when you just need a way out — one tap, and Mom calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:46.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,Today it's a seeded demo model that never breaks. Next, real OpenStreetMap and city data —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:50.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,then guardian networks and campus partnerships.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:57.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Built for SDGs five and eleven — because the walk home shouldn't be a risk calculation.
